<title>USA: Banner stake raised by Cramer group.</title>
<headline>Banner stake raised by Cramer group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York investor James Cramer on Thursday said it raised its stake in Banne Aerospace Inc to 2,199,000 common shares or 9.4 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include the purchase of 244,100 common shares between January 3 and February 13 at prices ranging from $8.50 to $9.379 per share.</p>
<p>Banner, based in Cleveland, Ohio, is a distributor of a large range of new and overhauled replacment parts in the aviation after market.</p>
</text>
